1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
He said he was only the middleman. He still got two years.

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:07,940
The middleman for what? The World Cup trophy. Okay, rewind.

3
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:12,880
It's London, nineteen sixty-six, and England hosts the World Cup in four months.

4
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:18,540
So where's the trophy? In a vault? Nope— a glass case, at a stamp show.

5
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,940
Then one Sunday in March, somebody just walks off with it.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,820
Yeah, the biggest prize in sport, gone from a stamp show.

7
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,340
Smash like if that security makes you mad.

8
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:33,040
But then a ransom note shows up. Basically, pay up or never see it again.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,940
It actually comes with a piece of the trophy's lining, signed by some guy calling himself Jackson.

10
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,360
Then police grab a dockworker named Edward Betchley.

11
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:45,540
Now his whole story is, I'm just the middleman, the thief is someone else.

12
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:49,060
But who's the thief? He never says, not once.

13
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:51,700
Send this to the friend who'd keep their mouth shut too.

14
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:55,840
Now, one week after the theft, David Corbett walks his dog, Pickles.

15
00:00:55,840 --> 00:01:00,180
Pickles sniffs out a package under a hedge in south London, wrapped in newspaper.

16
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:03,800
And inside? The World Cup. Found by a dog.

17
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:07,420
Wait, then the cops briefly treat the dog walker as a suspect.

18
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:10,460
Follow if you'd hire Pickles before half the police force.

19
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:14,520
Betchley's convicted over the ransom demand, and he's sentenced to two years.

20
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:18,400
But the actual thief? Nobody was ever convicted of taking it.

21
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:22,700
And yeah, that summer England won the World Cup, with a dog as the hero.

22
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:25,680
So was he really only the middleman? Yes or no?

